  },
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "fe26a33e-9f64-4725-954d-dc75d53f5114",
      "udi": "umb://element/ea8400f9e1824ba49ab9f2622ac45033"
    },
    {
      "actionLink": [
        {
          "name": "Our Vision & Mission",
          "udi": "umb://document/d26303f3aff94e7caa813fdf18b3132d"
        }
      ],
      "contentTypeKey": "6bfd106c-7558-496b-829c-992ecaaf9c73",
      "heading": "Breath Energy Health Foundation",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "image": [
        {
          "key": "315ad391-2584-4cd8-bfc1-4076bdcf646c",
          "mediaKey": "51583059-cff9-4495-909d-a065d3782823"
        }
      ],
      "mediaOnRight": "0",
      "notUseJbtOuter": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>BEHF is dedicated to empowering individuals, organizations, and communities by incorporating the life-enhancing approaches of <strong>Mindfulness</strong>, <strong>Meditation</strong>, and <strong>Spiritual Science</strong> into everyday life. We aim to reach each and every individual from all walks of life, offering accessible tools and techniques that foster inner-strength, clarity, well-being, and harmony in all aspects of life.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "shadowRichtext": "1",
      "showIcon": "0",
      "subHeading": "",
      "udi": "umb://element/4cf69951b3f34e54a0c12130e0c5ad3b",
      "youtubeVideo": ""
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "fe26a33e-9f64-4725-954d-dc75d53f5114",
      "udi": "umb://element/4dbc36c9bd2248ce847b81418f936bba"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Social Responsibility Commitment",
      "highlightParagraph": "As a social enterprise, BEHF is committed to reinvesting at least 51% of its profits into activities that promote social value.",
      "iconImage": [],
      "iconImageOnRight": "",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>We focus on addressing challenges related to work skills, collaboration, and leadership through meditation and mindfulness. BEHF not only provides solutions for businesses but also actively contributes to the sustainable development of the community.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/a1ebe3d695f74969b23f9ab9be524b0e"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": {
        "value": "0dcaf0",
        "label": "--bs-cyan-rgb",
        "sortOrder": 2,
        "id": "9"
      },
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "",
      "highlightParagraph": "In today’s fast-paced environment, balancing studies, work life, career, social life, and personal well-being can often feel overwhelming. But what if we say that one could cultivate a sense of inner peace, sharpen your focus, and reduce stress - all at a time? Here are our virtues:",
      "iconImage": [],
      "iconImageOnRight": "",
      "paragraph": "",
      "udi": "umb://element/0d48b2e0c437474b90707b9fe3b4255b"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "WHY?",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "643b7b85-bc7e-4f28-b18e-243f5efc4f96",
          "mediaKey": "cca17bb2-377a-4c90-8eb6-f505a440185a"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>BEHF provides a <strong>sanctuary</strong> for those seeking to <strong>reconnect with their inner-selves</strong>. Through guided meditation sessions, mindfulness workshops, and spiritual teachings, we help people tap into their true potential, unlocking creativity, resilience, and compassion.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/df74f3a8216e459995e3e937ffa4bf86"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "WHO?",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "2e601aaa-4d51-4f67-b340-2223e60e60bc",
          "mediaKey": "afe29441-36b9-4186-86e7-5a334eab3bc4"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageOnRight": "1",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Our programs are designed to nurture well-being on all levels – mental, emotional, and spiritual. We <em><strong>empower students</strong></em> to focus and perform at their best, <em><strong>assist organizations</strong></em> in minimizing workplace stress while boosting productivity, and <em><strong>guide individuals</strong></em> towards a greater fulfillment and personal growth.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/6e7084c45bee469d86fecf7e72bb1dd0"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "HOW?",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "7965b43d-d9c9-4cea-b94d-97361737109f",
          "mediaKey": "52497b9f-c3e9-4842-9ffa-29b5cd2aa063"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>By integrating spirituality into daily routines, we offer a bridge to deeper awareness and a more compassionate world. At <strong>BEHF</strong>, we believe that mindfulness and meditation aren’t just practices, but ways of living that lead to a more peaceful, mindful, and purposeful existence.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/2b245a004f404a9daf46a73cf7dbf3dd"
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e40dc2c5-e4e4-4641-a53d-e1ffbd5ffb16",
